	(text "Si5351A IC"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 57.658 74.676 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3.048 3.048)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "112e22b1-3ee7-4eff-bca8-ec90b0b2ac83")
	)
	(text "CLOCK GENERATOR"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 56.134 39.116 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3.048 3.048)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "441196d4-53df-4e2c-bd34-5519702d9a9e")
	)
	(text "I2C Pull-Up Resistors"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 58.42 176.3522 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3.048 3.048)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8bec998c-8d28-492a-9f7e-458d49739c8c")
	)
	(text_box "I2C pull-ups: 4.7kOhm to +3V3. Si5351A address = 0x60 (7-bit).  Standard mode (100 kHz) or Fast mode (400 kHz).  These are the ONLY I2C pull-ups on the comms board -- the EPS board has its own pull-ups for the LTC4162.  If the bus is too slow ( rounded edges on SCL), try 2.2kOhm.  If multiple devices on the bus have pull-ups, the effective resisance drops --- may need to remove one set."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 157.48 181.4322 0)
		(size -48.26 25.4)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 150 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "032cbd19-f058-42ab-8433-ab1d91971488")
	)
	(text_box "CLOCK GENERATOR -- Si5351A (I2C address 0x60). Generates three independent clock outputs from a single 25 MHz crystal. CLK0 = 145.67 MHz (TX carrier, tripled to 437 MHz). CLK1 = 145.9 MHz (RX local oscillator for ADE-1+ passive mixer; see RX sheet). CLK2 = spare. All outputs driven at 8 mA (max) intio 50Ohm loads.  Controlled by RP2040 over I2C."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 57.15 40.64 0)
		(size 139.7 20.32)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 255 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "19346b28-8d34-4f18-a4f0-148943fce16a")
	)
	(text_box "Match to crystal's specified load capacitance.  If crystal specifies 8pF load, use 10pF caps.  If crystal specifies 10pF load, use 15pF caps.  C0G/NP0 dielectric is mandatory -- X7R temperature drift will shift frequency."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 59.69 78.0432 0)
		(size 53.34 12.1268)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 150 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3ff77303-a20f-4799-a8c8-8b15b992d6c2")
	)
	(text_box "C5/C6 at VDD: place C5 (100nF) directly at pin 1 with shortest possible traces. C6 (10uF) can be further away C7 at VDDO: Place directly at pin 6."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 165.1 78.74 0)
		(size 35.56 12.1268)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 150 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "535febbe-5073-437b-8b2b-4fd8b0f050a4")
	)
	(text_box "DC blocking caps prevent Si5351A output bias from affecting downstream stages. 33Ω series resistors provide impedance matching and reduce ringing on traces. Si5351A outputs are push-pull CMOS with ~~50Ω source impedance at 8mA drive setting. CLK0 feeds the XOR BPSK modulator at 145.67 MHz. CLK1 feeds the ADE-1+ passive mixer LO at 145.9 MHz (target +7 dBm at the mixer LO pin) through a 5-pole LC LPF on the RX sheet that suppresses square-wave harmonics. **Consider populating R4 as 0Ω instead of 33Ω** to preserve drive into the LPF/mixer chain — verify CLK1 power on the bench before committing. CLK2 reserved — bring to a test header if board space permits."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 161.29 138.2522 0)
		(size 76.2 23.0378)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
			(color 0 0 0 1)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 150 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6d74d1d3-fff0-4498-b49b-7b62cb39355c")
	)
